comments.body:
@jospoortvliet can we mention this somewhere on our website?

Good explanation: https://www.dropbox.com/help/mobile/background-uploading-location-data

@all I understand your complaints. This is how it is. It is a technical limitation, and similar things exist on Android (however, they are resolved differently). We will try to make this more clear, but technically there's not much we can do except for allowing to disable background uploading. cc @marinofaggiana
